# --- api/ (Go) ---

# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out

# Dependency directory (unused with Go modules)
/api/vendor

# Compiled application binary
/api/steadylearn-api
/api/build

# Generated swagger docs (api/docs) are committed on purpose: main.go imports
# the docs package, so the project would not build from a clean clone without it.

